{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/extras/16b15c50d1dd18f607f74c03d30972d8.poster.avif?t=1767892327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/extras/16b15c50d1dd18f607f74c03d30972d8.webm?t=1767892327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/extras/16b15c50d1dd18f607f74c03d30972d8.mp4?t=1767892327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steady your blade -<i> and spin!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After my last game SUMMERHOUSE, I wanted to make something radically different. Still small, but faster, with numbers, fights and goblins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is SLOTS &amp; DAGGERS, a strange little blend of slot machine and fantasy RPG.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make this game I combined a lot of things I deeply love \u2013 weird fantasy worlds, crude drawings of strange little guys, old school crunchy hiphop drum machines and addictive arcade games that go \u201cPLING PLING PLING\u201d as they spit out little coins \u2013 with classic roguelike mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The features of this game are:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun slot machine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-8 hour campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crude drawings of strange little guys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunchy hip hop drum machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Egg arena\u2019 high score mode for the truly determined</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive arcade gameplay that goes \u201cpling\u201d a lot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers! Fights! Goblins!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As with SUMMERHOUSE, please keep in mind this game is a solo project - small, focused, and made with care. It\u2019s meant to be short and sweet and doesn\u2019t have the amount of content as games built by bigger teams over years, but I think it\u2019s a fair deal!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you have a good time with SLOTS &amp; DAGGERS &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friedemann</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/49ec0f9e38f953a54bcfd0a522c57787951a3985.jpg"},{"name":"Plains Of Pain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/b0c3d5f13b53bb60a15dc3fdf776cbe29fac95de.jpg"},{"name":"The Black Cemetery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/c08da22818b8cc0d28dfdddc94c575ecd8c87801.jpg"},{"name":"Cursed Swamp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/8d35aaeb0d981cd71b2439f55c5a8f949f26a0c0.jpg"},{"name":"Red Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/1cd1c38a9fc34b3bc2d5cf64ed969788d2d2b0db.jpg"},{"name":"Sewers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/9c28a03800c7825871756e75653739ef4fcd956d.jpg"},{"name":"Cathedral of Smoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/8fbf9da0e6f08a78b9838b137910baccb66bb195.jpg"},{"name":"The Citadel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/aab51c20c8509b2484ca29cce1bd018440bcc135.jpg"},{"name":"The Petrified Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/b05159dc0b9c071ee42bcd42eb87ed62fd524bc5.jpg"},{"name":"The Ministry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3631290/be8b0f5ac9a6459fc9bf819ae52785cc13e101e9.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631290?t=1767892327","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/1558112b2b14672bd226868045955df2e68d9baa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767892327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/8930a3333520bff75be49d946f9a5c47fc10ba2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767892327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/8930a3333520bff75be49d946f9a5c47fc10ba2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767892327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/extras/16b15c50d1dd18f607f74c03d30972d8.poster.avif?t=1767892327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/extras/16b15c50d1dd18f607f74c03d30972d8.webm?t=1767892327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631290/extras/16b15c50d1dd18f607f74c03d30972d8.mp4?t=1767892327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steady your blade -<i> and spin!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After my last game SUMMERHOUSE, I wanted to make something radically different. Still small, but faster, with numbers, fights and goblins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is SLOTS &amp; DAGGERS, a strange little blend of slot machine and fantasy RPG.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make this game I combined a lot of things I deeply love \u2013 weird fantasy worlds, crude drawings of strange little guys, old school crunchy hiphop drum machines and addictive arcade games that go \u201cPLING PLING PLING\u201d as they spit out little coins \u2013 with classic roguelike mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The features of this game are:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun slot machine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-8 hour campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crude drawings of strange little guys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunchy hip hop drum machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Egg arena\u2019 high score mode for the truly determined</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive arcade gameplay that goes \u201cpling\u201d a lot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers! Fights! Goblins!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As with SUMMERHOUSE, please keep in mind this game is a solo project - small, focused, and made with care. It\u2019s meant to be short and sweet and doesn\u2019t have the amount of content as games built by bigger teams over years, but I think it\u2019s a fair deal!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you have a good time with SLOTS &amp; DAGGERS &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friedemann</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Friedemann"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.